<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on BMW.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on BMW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG (BMW).</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE SHARE IS CONTROLLED BY 10 WARRANTS.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	25.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1497 DEM</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p>  CALL	1500 DEM    24.36 DEM   16.5 PCT    6.1 X</p>
<p>  CALL	1750 DEM    15.34 DEM   27.1 PCT    27.1 X</p>
<p>NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   MSSXA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
